>
	<p>
		<strong>LIP Industrie Précision</strong> is a general and precision machining workshop located at
		2D chemin de l'Ermitage in Besançon (25000), France. True to our motto — "The guarantee of a
		precise response" — we produce finished parts, from single units to medium runs, in all ferrous
		and non-ferrous metals as well as plastics.
	</p>

	<p>
		Our workshop masters the entire machining chain in-house: traditional and CNC turning and
		milling, surface and cylindrical grinding, and EDM (wire and ram). This autonomy lets us handle
		complete projects and deliver a fast, controlled response to our customers' requests.
	</p>

	<p>
		<strong>ISO 9001</strong> certified, we place quality and continuous improvement at the heart of
		our process. Our inspection equipment (coordinate measuring machine, OGP optical camera, profile
		projectors, comparators, micrometers) ensures the conformity of every part we deliver.
	</p>

	<p>
		We work for demanding sectors: medical, space, connectors, hydraulics, pneumatics, automotive,
		aerospace, defence and telephony. To learn more about our resources and expertise, visit&#32;<a href="https://www.lip-industrie.com/en/">lip-industrie.com</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
